@listId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{$dotenv SUPABASE_URL}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{$dotenv SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv SUPABASE_USER_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv SUPABASE_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Define a todo list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definelist/{{listId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
correlation_id: {{listId}}

{
  "name": "My todo list"
}
